lection process (if applicable).</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Download and save the<strong> result PDF</strong> for future reference.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Take a printout of the <strong>result for future use.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 188px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 53px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center; height: 53px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">\u00a0UPSC IES/ISS Recruitment 2026 : </span>Mode Of Selection\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 135px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; height: 135px;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><b>Pre Examination</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Mains Examination</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><b>Interview</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-text\"><strong><strong><strong>SOME USEFUL IMPORTANT LINKS</strong></strong></strong></h6>\n<script async=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-9762662687323163\" type=\"d7ae5f18f6f1c453872790d6-text/javascript\"></script>\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-9762662687323163\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7596594071\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display:block\"></ins>\n<script type=\"d7ae5f18f6f1c453872790d6-text/javascript\">\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\n</script>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-761d9c16\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4b7d6947 importaint_links gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody